{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9ee96c5e020facb9","name":"Influential Contacts","source":{"id":"source:reference-9ee96c5e020facb9","title":"Influential Contacts","revision":19493,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:04:20Z","sha256":"9b74e3d6a84eeb381aa0cf8010747559444265d4d32c91d360984ec323bb7a63","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19493","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Influential%20Contacts&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9ee96c5e020facb9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Influential Friends"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Influential_Friends"}]}," Talent grants a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," an automatic high ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," result that is the result of calling in favors from some well-connected allies. Some Gamemasters might wonder what the Talent really represents. In essence, when a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," uses this Talent, they call in a favor from a contact, who sends a representative who has that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," (or just conveys the result of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},") to the heroes.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["For example, if the heroes need information on a crime lord but have no one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," uses this Talent, and their contacts supply the heroes with the information from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," check. Likewise, if the heroes need to get past a security checkpoint in a very important mission, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," calls upon their ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Influential Friends"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Influential_Friends"}]}," to have a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check made to provide the heroes with high-quality fake identification and paperwork. The heroes must have access to planetary or interplanetary communications systems to use the Talent.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
